#567 fbctrlcmdkill -- PRE-TABLE ADDENDUM for kill table 2, written 2026-10-19 ~05:4x BEFORE the table runs (this file's
mtime is the order proof).  INSTRUMENT: probe v2 (99 rows; the session scratchpad's fbctrl_cmd_probe.v2.py, frozen into
the table's directory as probe.v2.frozen.py.txt), the pass-2 repairs of kill table 2a's three escapes plus the channel
and exit-status repairs pass 2 named.  BASELINE: the fix, in the scratch clone /tmp/gx567 (both clearance parts).  Its two
legs before this table (session scratchpad v2legs/): the fix 99/99, HEAD's binary 38/99.

THE TABLE re-runs EVERY mutant built so far on the new instrument -- tables 1 (B_gateoff, D1-D10), 1b (E1-E5) and 2a
(E6-E14), 25 in all -- and both null media, because new rows change other mutants' scores and the floor is asked of the
shipped composite, not of the instrument each mutant was first measured on.

PREDICTIONS
* Every one of the 25 mutants RED.
* The three that ESCAPED table 2a, with the rows the repairs added:
    E12_elseif    rdcmd again (0x0), rdx1 again (0x0)                                       -> 97/99
    E13_lenne4    acc nop cmd (0x2) + quiet; acc set cmd (0x0), ran (0), res (0), quiet;
                  acc get cmd (0x0), x1 (0x7b), y1 (0x4d), quiet                             -> 89/99
    E14_latchwide two once ('-'), two cmd ('-'): T2 dies in default: on its third write; and
                  sessions clean (21)                                                        -> 96/99
* `sessions clean' red exactly under the mutants that kill a session -- B_gateoff, D5 (byte/halfword 3 and 4 reach the
  default:), E1 (FILL accepted), E5 (m1d), E10 (nothing refused), E11 (m1w, m1d), E14 (T2) -- and green under the
  other eighteen, whose refusals and announces kill nothing.
* `ref w1 noset' red under B_gateoff and D1 (SET runs in R:w1) -- the channel nosmall lacked.
* Null media (an absent binary, /bin/true): CONTROL=FAILED, every session NO-PROMPT, 15/99 -- the eleven noset rows and
  four quiet counts read 0 on a dead session; `acc set res' (0) and `sessions clean' (0) are red among the 84.
